    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Saga of the Great Wolf",
    "summary": "Your ADEPTUS ASTARTES units with this ability, other than MONSTER and VEHICLE units, gain three abilities. Encircling Jaws: under the assault doctrine, the unit adds 1 to its Charge rolls and Advance rolls. Hunter's Eye: under the devastator doctrine, its ranged attacks may re-roll a Hit roll of 1. Ferocious Strike: under the tactical doctrine, its attacks gain [Sustained Hits 1] against an enemy unit that the card describes as \"with\" 9 inches. Your Logan Grimnar units have Howling Onslaught, which your army can use once per battle during your Command phase; when used, your Adeptus Astartes Monster and Vehicle units also benefit from Master of Wolves until your next Command phase starts. Restrictions: Space Wolves units are allowed in your army, but Adeptus Astartes units from any other Chapter are not. The card reads \"with\" rather than \"within\" before the 9-inch distance, so it does not settle which enemy units Ferocious Strike covers.",
